  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Sky Manipulation — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>Once you reach 3rd level, you have become better at manipulating the space around you. As a bonus action for 1 Cursed Energy, you can cover part of your body with a part of the sky, making those parts covered invisible for 1 hour. While you have this armor equipped, your AC is 11 + Your Cursed Energy modifier + your proficiency bonus. You also gain a flying speed equal to your walking speed while under the effects of <em>Sky Armor</em>.</p>",
